# The logistic map, for cobwebbing (XPPAUT 8.4, 25 Nov 2026)
# Viewaxes -> Cobweb draws the cobweb of x(n+1) = r x(n) (1-x(n)) from the
#   initial condition (it works for 1D maps). Change r: 2.8 (a fixed
#   point), 3.2 (period 2), 3.5 (period 4), 3.9 (chaos).
par r=3.7
init x=0.2
x'=r*x*(1-x)
@ meth=discrete,total=200
@ xp=t,yp=x,xlo=0,xhi=200,ylo=0,yhi=1
d
